69	///
70	/// Kept for API compatibility with existing callers, and safe to use
71	/// standalone. Note that this re-fetches the full tag list (gix discovery
72	/// or a `CommandRunner` round-trip) on every call; callers resolving tags
73	/// for many packages at once -- notably [`TagIndex::build`] -- fetch the
74	/// list once and reuse it across packages rather than calling this
75	/// function in a loop.
